Query: Perform the following analysis on the gene expression dataset at /mnt/data/lengyang/youjia_project/autoba/BABench/src/promptbio-bench/tasks/b-6-9/result_79/toolsgenie_20260709/data/gene_expression.csv:

1. Load the CSV (index_col=0). Separate the 'Group' column (labels) from the 50 gene expression columns (features).
2. Apply 2D metric MDS (sklearn.manifold.MDS, n_components=2, random_state=42, dissimilarity='euclidean', normalized_stress='auto') to the gene expression matrix. Extract the stress_ attribute.
3. From the 2D MDS coordinates:
   a. Compute group centroids (mean of MDS coords for each group).
   b. Between-group distance: average of all pairwise Euclidean distances between group centroids.
   c. Within-group distance: average of all pairwise Euclidean distances among samples within each group, averaged across all groups.
   d. Compute Between_Within_Ratio = between_group_distance / within_group_distance.
4. Write results to /mnt/data/lengyang/youjia_project/autoba/BABench/src/promptbio-bench/tasks/b-6-9/result_79/toolsgenie_20260709/data/mds_results.txt with two labeled lines:
   Stress: <value>
   Between_Within_Ratio: <value>
   Print the file contents to verify.
